{"message":"I can help with all three requests, but I must verify your identity before accessing or changing your accounts. Please provide your full name and any two of the following: date of birth, email address, phone number, or mailing address.

Based on the available account information, the documented highest base savings rate is the Platinum Account at 6.5% APY, requiring a $50,000 minimum balance. A qualifying Blue Account checking relationship may add a 0.8% boost, for a potential 7.3% APY, though I’ll confirm your eligibility and the current applicable terms after verification.

For your Light Blue Account, closure requires an open account with no pending transactions. There is no notice period, and a $15 early-closure fee applies only if it was opened within the last 30 days; the fee is deducted from the account balance. I’ll check these conditions before attempting closure. Please also confirm whether you prefer the Blue Account or the Bluest Account for your replacement checking account."}
